message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
  Quantum-opposite reading of a spiral-envelope toy mode, synthetic
  only. No claim about real atoms, real electromagnetism, or quantum
  mechanics.
abstract: >-
  The quantum opposite of a spiral-envelope mode on a 2D disk: the same
  decaying envelope and frozen closure gate, read as a normalised
  quantum amplitude with the winding reversed. The opposite is invisible
  in density, orthogonal in amplitude, opposite in angular momentum,
  and visible only by interference. Standard library only.
